8197-a529624bbc61\" width=\"400\"></img>\n\nI copied the chat text and pasted into a new chat session. Before submitting, you can see the \"#file:WARP-...\" portion is not highlighted. Note also that \"#changes\" is highlighted, and \"git changes\" is in the context preview:\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7a4714f-076d-49fb-98a9-cc09d68121c4\" width=\"400\"></img>\n\nAnd, to confirm, when the chat is submitted, \"#changes\" was attached correctly, but the file was not:\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c01fb07-b2b5-447d-aef7-fa7657c51d14\" width=\"400\"></img>\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2913423671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2923247972","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/10868#issuecomment-2923247972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/10868","id":2923247972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6uPTlk","user":{"login":"vs-code-engineering[bot]","id":122617954,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOB08AYg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/281319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vs-code-engineering","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vs-code-engineering%5Bbot